{"product_id":"read-it-yourself-with-ladybird-level-3-collection-copy","title":"Read It Yourself with Ladybird – Level 2 Collection(16 Books)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"354\"\u003eReading becomes more exciting as stories get longer and adventures get bigger.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"356\" data-end=\"636\"\u003eRead It Yourself with Ladybird – Level 2 is designed for children aged 5–7 who are ready to read with growing confidence. These books feature slightly longer sentences, new vocabulary, and engaging plots, all supported by bright illustrations that help bring each story to life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"962\"\u003eFrom fairy tales to playful animal adventures and modern favourites like Peppa Pig, each story encourages children to read independently while enjoying the thrill of following a story from start to finish. Perfect for bedtime, school reading, or quiet weekend reading time, these books make every page a joyful experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1400\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1009\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1009\"\u003eSleeping Beauty\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1026\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1026\"\u003eDom’s Dragon\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1046\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1046\"\u003eRumpelstiltskin\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1072\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1072\"\u003ePeppa Pig: Sports Day\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1091\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1091\"\u003eChicken Licken\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1092\" data-end=\"1119\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1119\"\u003ePeppa Pig: Nature Trail\u003c\/p\